# MEMORY.md

This repo is one ops project. Experience lives in the root `MEMORY.md`, not in this rule.

Read `MEMORY.md` before changing deploy scripts, compose, or `personal_config`. When a local attempt fails or a path works, append a short English bullet there under `GOTCHA` or `TASTE`.

Never write API keys, bot tokens, or inference tokens into `MEMORY.md`, git, or logs.
